---
source: crates/cosmon-cli/tests/help_goldens.rs
expression: stdout
---
Print a canonical v1 grant and its exact bytes for an external signer

Usage: cs harvest-authority challenge [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>            Path to configuration file
      --molecule <MOLECULE>      Grant for exactly this molecule
      --mission <MISSION>        Grant for a mission rooted here
  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose output
      --expires-at <EXPIRES_AT>  Requested UTC expiry; default is one hour from now
      --json                     Output in JSON format
      --no-expiry                Explicitly request a grant without expiry
  -h, --help                     Print help
